&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgECpKKZRKKPMq9FqoVaa0Nh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgeTThLuM0tLetEOUdIa1U1f&quot;&gt;Compliance at OKX is a trusted partner to the business. We&#39;re a team of risk-minded problem solvers who make sure OKX grows safely and sustainably. We advise on regulatory obligations, uphold strong controls, and continuously improve our processes so the business can scale responsibly.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgBLYzk7XrfAQwwG3t2svrAO&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgBLYzk7XrfAQwwG3t2svrAO&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgzZbekDEr7h0YwjtfVsY7Ng&quot;&gt;As Head of Compliance, Europe &amp;amp; UK, you&#39;ll lead the compliance program across OKX&#39;s European and UK entities. You&#39;ll report to the Deputy Chief Compliance Officer and Head of International Compliance, and take the regional function to its next level of maturity.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgmLHZKnfoVjJPwHcVaOCId3&quot;&gt;Your mandate is to build a robust, efficient compliance program that supports sustainable growth. You&#39;ll lead a team of Country Heads of Compliance and MLROs, bringing them together as a cohesive, high-performing regional team. Each will keep their local regulatory responsibilities and decision-making authority.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgZl2wONIv6ApBRdJDoeJh8c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Set the strategic direction and lead delivery of the compliance program across all OKX entities in Europe and the UK.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgfZYl0N0tgBnoTdMuowRpGg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead, support and develop Country Heads of Compliance and MLROs, strengthening consistency across the region while preserving local accountability and decision-making.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EXiNdpfhCoGA8Mxv2EclnLHOg9e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain the independence of the compliance function, with direct access to local Boards and the authority to challenge the business where needed.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OyOVdB6iWoM3GcxXi9SlWEmOgEd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Review current workflows and improve them. Put in place scalable frameworks, and use data, automation and AI-enabled tools to improve the quality and timeliness of decisions while keeping controls strong.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WD0BdrsMJoTQPexnNrPlXjkcgic&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Work with first-, second- and third-line teams to build a control environment that meets or exceeds regulatory expectations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LWvNdhPFRoICOlxU2FClRPbGghf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as a senior point of contact for regulators, leading or supporting examinations, inquiries and supervisory engagement.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IzUCdigpqoNtJzx7VrMlUsAGgwh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with Business, Product and Legal on licensing scope assessments and compliance input for new products and market entries.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F4bxdQpQxoKb1RxKCpHlkDBSggb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build strong partnerships with business leaders and stakeholders across Product, Legal, Operations and Risk, giving clear, practical guidance on the compliance implications of commercial decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O5VQdJWSOoKFlSxMTF2lnA9ggpc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Produce data-driven compliance reports for management and local Boards, using metrics, SLAs and KPIs that show the effectiveness of the compliance program.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RqeNdgcR0o1pjCx5WJqljF0Kgof&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Take part in Board and committee meetings, as a member or as needed.&lt;/div&gt
